<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Pre-battle Sermon -->
  <DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.label>战前布道</DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.label>
  <!-- EN: The Moralist of DivineDiurganate deliver a pre-battle sermon for the upcoming battle, and each participant will receive a divine blessing based on the quality of the speech, making them braver and more difficult to kill on the battlefield. The quality of the speech is related to the social attributes of the exorcist. -->
  <DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.description>圣双尾教的传教士对即将到来的大战进行战前布道，每位与会者将根据演讲的质量获得神佑，使得她们在战场上更加勇猛、更加难以被击杀。演讲的质量和传教士的社交属性相关。</DD_Moralist_PrewarSpeech.description>
  
</LanguageData>